Package: hazf
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libzstd1, libgtk-4-1
Description: HAZF archive tool - Hyggshi Archive Zip Format
 Hyggshi Archive Zip Format (HAZF) is an independent binary archive
 format using Zstandard compression, little-endian encoding and CRC32
 integrity checking.
 .
 This package provides the `hazf` command line tool and `hazf-gui`
 GTK4 graphical front-end supporting create, list, extract, test
 and info operations for .hazf archives with polished icons,
 drag-and-drop and animated UI.
 Its prototype limits are 8 GiB per file and 1,000,000 entries, and
 it handles regular files with relative POSIX paths.
